<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27355" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διπλᾰσι-ασμός</span></b> , ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>doubling,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Antipho Soph.
				75
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ κύβου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Sis.</u>
					388e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ στερεοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.718f
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Gramm.,
				<i>the Ionic doubling of consonants,</i> as in <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόσσος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				68.47
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				73.3
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>reduplication,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				323.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> in Tactics,
				<i>doubling of front,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ascl.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				10.18
			</span></i>, etc.; of Numbers, ib.<i><span class="en">
				17
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> in
			Anatomy, <i>cross-action</i> of muscles, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(2).974
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίπλωσις</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHolm.</u>
				1.39
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
